1
00:00:00,078 --> 00:00:01,429
Homo erectus,

2
00:00:01,429 --> 00:00:04,012
manusia purba di buku sejarah kita...

3
00:00:04,012 --> 00:00:06,751
ternyata bertahan paling
akhir di Indonesia!

4
00:00:06,751 --> 00:00:09,256
Setelah hampir 2 juta tahun,

5
00:00:09,256 --> 00:00:11,840
yang terakhir hidup di
tepi Bengawan Solo...

6
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:14,325
sekitar 110 ribu tahun lalu.

7
00:00:14,325 --> 00:00:15,548
Ilmuwan menduga,

8
00:00:15,548 --> 00:00:17,867
hutan hujan yang memusnahkan mereka.

9
00:00:17,867 --> 00:00:22,260
Tapi studi baru di jurnal Nature
menemukan Homo erectus di China...

10
00:00:22,260 --> 00:00:24,384
justru betah di hutan hujan!

11
00:00:24,384 --> 00:00:25,391
Jadi...

12
00:00:25,391 --> 00:00:26,986
apa yang sebenarnya terjadi?

13
00:00:26,986 --> 00:00:27,603
Follow,

14
00:00:27,603 --> 00:00:29,981
besok ada yang lebih aneh.
